-08-06","details":{"category":"destination","includeInParentGallery":true,"positionQuality":"mapped feature","coordinateSource":"OpenStreetMap node 358277245","informationSourceLabel":"Boston Parks and Recreation","informationSourceUrl":"https://www.boston.gov/parks/boston-common","informationCheckedAt":"2026-08-06","imageUrl":"/assets/parks/boston-super/boston-common/04-boston-common-may-2018-003-jpg.webp","imageSourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Boston_Common_May_2018_003.jpg","imageAuthor":"King of Hearts","imageLicense":"CC BY-SA 4.0","imageAlt":"Flagstaff Hill and Soldiers and Sailors Monument at Boston Common"}},{"id":"9bae404b-808a-4200-b6e9-482bee8c5cde","slug":"parkman-bandstand","name":"Parkman Bandstand","feature_type":"destination","description":"The Parkman Bandstand is in the southern half of the Common near Tremont and Boylston Streets. It is an outdoor landmark and event space, so permitted programs can occupy the surrounding lawn and paths.","latitude":42.3543415,"longitude":-71.0655032,"source_label":"Boston Parks and Recreation","source_url":"https://www.boston.gov/parks/boston-common","verified_at":"2026-08-06","details":{"category":"destination","includeInParentGallery":true,"positionQuality":"mapped feature","coordinateSource":"OpenStreetMap way 29576185","informationSourceLabel":"Boston Parks and Recreation","informationSourceUrl":"https://www.boston.gov/parks/boston-common","informationCheckedAt":"2026-08-06","imageUrl":"/assets/parks/boston-super/boston-common/01-boston-common-may-2018-004-jpg.webp","imageSourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Boston_Common_May_2018_004.jpg","imageAuthor":"King of Hearts","imageLicense":"CC BY-SA 4.0","imageAlt":"Parkman Bandstand at Boston Common"}},{"id":"69e0d02e-14b2-4b43-b616-3edfe46174d2","slug":"central-burying-ground","name":"Central Burying Ground","feature_type":"destination","description":"Central Burying Ground is along Boylston Street near Tremont Street. It has its own roughly daytime gate schedule, historic uneven surfaces, and no stair-free access, so do not assume the full Common's hours or accessibility.","latitude":42.352889,"longitude":-71.0659823,"source_label":"City of Boston Historic Burying Grounds","source_url":"https://www.boston.gov/cemeteries/central-burying-ground","verified_at":"2026-08-06","details":{"category":"destination","includeInParentGallery":true,"positionQuality":"mapped feature","coordinateSource":"OpenStreetMap way 29818933","informationSourceLabel":"City of Boston Historic Burying Grounds","informationSourceUrl":"https://www.boston.gov/cemeteries/central-burying-ground","informationCheckedAt":"2026-08-06","imageUrl":"/assets/parks/boston-super/boston-common/02-boston-common-november-2016-004-jpg.webp","imageSourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Boston_Common_November_2016_004.jpg","imageAuthor":"King of Hearts","imageLicense":"CC BY-SA 4.0","imageAlt":"Central Burying Ground at Boston Common"}},{"id":"4aabf2c9-5fe4-4bda-80b6-5b8ca30b4dfd","slug":"robert-gould-shaw-and-54th-regiment-memorial","name":"Robert Gould Shaw and 54th Regiment Memorial","feature_type":"destination","description":"The memorial faces the State House along Beacon Street at the northeast edge of the Common. Approach from Beacon or Park Street and expect a short uphill route from Tremont Street.","latitude":42.3574806,"longitude":-71.0635011,"source_label":"Boston Parks and Recreation","source_url":"https://www.boston.gov/parks/boston-common","verified_at":"2026-08-06","details":{"category":"destination","includeInParentGallery":true,"positionQuality":"mapped feature","coordinateSource":"OpenStreetMap node 358276404","informationSourceLabel":"Boston Parks and Recreation","informationSourceUrl":"https://www.boston.gov/parks/boston-common","informationCheckedAt":"2026-08-06","imageUrl":"/assets/parks/boston-super/boston-common/03-boston-common-may-2018-001-jpg.webp","imageSourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Boston_Common_May_2018_001.jpg","imageAuthor":"King of Hearts","imageLicense":"CC BY-SA 4.0","imageAlt":"Robert Gould Shaw and 54th Regiment Memorial at Boston Common"}},{"id":"28736fdd-f143-40cc-8328-f2adcff2e41c","slug":"boston-common-off-leash-dog-areas","name":"Boston Common off-leash dog areas","feature_type":"destination","description":"Boston Common uses rotating, signed off-leash areas rather than one permanent fenced dog park. Confirm the current posted area on arrival; dogs must remain leashed elsewhere and are excluded from playground and Frog Pond facilities.","latitude":42.3549,"longitude":-71.0675,"source_label":"Boston Parks and Recreation","source_url":"https://www.boston.gov/parks/boston-common","verified_at":"2026-08-06","details":{"category":"destination","includeInParentGallery":true,"positionQuality":"approximate activity area","coordinateSource":"AuditMap reviewed Boston Common plan placement","informationSourceLabel":"Boston Parks and Recreation","informationSourceUrl":"https://www.boston.gov/parks/boston-common","informationCheckedAt":"2026-08-06","imageUrl":"/assets/parks/boston-super/boston-common/04-boston-common-may-2018-003-jpg.webp","imageSourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Boston_Common_May_2018_003.jpg","imageAuthor":"King of Hearts","imageLicense":"CC BY-SA 4.0","imageAlt":"Boston Common off-leash dog areas at Boston Common"}}]}
